      "description": "Native checkbox with browser checked, unchecked, and disabled states; label target is at least 32px high.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span>Enabled</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;cursor:pointer;font:12px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;min-height:32px;color:var(--ink,#242820)}.ds-toggle input{width:17px;height:17px;accent-color:var(--green,#365339);cursor:pointer}.ds-toggle input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#a65313);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-toggle{color:var(--ink,#eef1e6)}.ds-toggle input{accent-color:var(--green,#c2dab1)}.ds-toggle input:focus-visible{outline-color:var(--focus,#ebaa6c)}}"
